==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Floragato|14}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Leaf Step''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Shining Celebi|79}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Floragato}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

